{"language":"kr","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","夺魂秘刃"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/kr","영혼의 칼날"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","对能量最多的敌人造成伤害、削减能量。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/kr","에너지가 가장 많은 적에게 대미지 및 에너지 감소를 부여한다."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","对一名敌人造成300% + 50% ATK伤害、削减其200点能量。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","적 1명에게 300% + 50% ATK의 대미지를 입히고, 목표의 에너지가 200 감소한다."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":7,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至320% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 320% + 50% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至340% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 340% + 50% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:A